==English==
{{wp|Disney (disambiguation)}}
[[File:Walt_Disney_Studios_Alameda_Entrance.jpg|thumb|right|The [[w:Walt Disney Studios (Burbank)|Walt Disney Studios]], the headquarters of The Walt Disney Company.]]

===Etymology===
{{dercat|en|la|cel|cel-gau|gem}}
English surname of {{der|en|nrf|-}} origin, from {{der|en|fro|de||of, from}} + {{m|fro|Isigny|pos=a place in {{l|en|Calvados}}}}. For the placename, see {{m|fr|Isigny-sur-Mer}}. In modern use, it is also derived from the name of {{w|Walt Disney}}, whose surname has the aforementioned origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈdɪzni/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Disney.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{surname|en|from=Old French}}.
# {{w|The Walt Disney Company}}, named after {{w|Walt Disney}}.
#: {{ux|en|Have you seen '''Disney's''' latest film?}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} Any of the theme parks and vacation resorts operated by {{w|Walt Disney Parks and Resorts}}.
#: {{ux|en|We went to '''Disney''' with the kids this summer.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1990|coauthors=Bill Sample (interviewee)|author=Bill Berkowitz|title=Local Heroes|publisher=Lexington Books|ISBN=0669158305|page=261|passage=And they included children down the seashore, they included going to the mountains; our first '''Disney''' child was not until 1978, no, ’77. {{...}} I mean, when you say to somebody, “I’m going to give you a trip to '''Disney''',” or “I’m going to buy you a Cabbage Patch doll,” and we’re doing this for you for absolutely nothing, that’s a reward in itself.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=Doug Stumpf|title=Confessions of a Wall Street Shoeshine Boy|publisher=HarperCollins|ISBN=0060889543|page=155|passage=If they found any phone number from the U.S., anything, they’d deport us right away because we came here on excursion with a whole bunch of people that was going to visit '''Disney'''. That’s what everybody usually do: They say, We going to visit '''Disney''', and we going to stay there for a week, and then we going to go back, but they end up staying.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2008|author=Flay Scott|title=The Inheritance|page=3|passage=Angela asked if we could treat ourselves to a few days at '''Disney'''. {{...}} The week included a couple of days in '''Disney''', Dad’s 70<sup>th</sup> birthday and then the long trip home.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2009|author=Cleo Stinyard III|title=Sex, Love, & Consequences|ISBN=1440497664|page=213|passage=I had decided to take them, my niece, and three nephews to '''Disney''' in Orlando, FL. I was going to try and make history. I was going to make an attempt at escorting more than four Dredd kids to '''Disney''' at once and live to tell about it.}}
# {{place|en|town|co/Mayes County|s/Oklahoma|c/USA}}, named after {{w|Wesley E. Disney}}.

